e\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5974 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(773.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1829.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2329.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2901.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3290.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4012.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5013,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5585,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, we need to find the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.122ex\" height=\"1.464ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 496 647\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> component vector of the initial velocity. (Given: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.618ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 5577.1 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(757.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1813.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2813.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1433,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1933,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(427,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>)</p>\n\n<p>The trajectory equation can be expanded as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.743ex\" height=\"2.351ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 5632.6 1038.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(773.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1829.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2329.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3123.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4124,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4624,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>In the general form of a projectile's trajectory: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.458ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.456ex\" height=\"3.889ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1074.6 8157.5 1718.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(773.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1829.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2568.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"74\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-74\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4013.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4179.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4871.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(5871.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(6664.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,485) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(480,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(420.5,-423) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(518,353.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(518,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1252.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Here, the equation compares as follows:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.033ex;